hash 40944294b7ba26d9
note Re-promoting reuses the step a symbol already has instead of adding a second one, which also means notes already written survive. Only a step anchored at the symbol's first line counts as the symbol's step, so a step narrowed to a slice of it does not stop the whole symbol from being added.
